Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban remote stand-aside: match the lease holder
 against both verified gateway pids; compacted-chat test (PR #2208 nits 1 & 3)

Follow-up t_01a1d527c5b43192 of review t_01a1d4ff020fea32 on PR #2208.

Nit 1 (behaviour): `canonical_gateway_pid` yielded one candidate: the profile home's gateway, else the
multiplexed default gateway. When both are live and the DEFAULT gateway runs the chat's turn, its lease
was not matched, so the Desktop sweep fell back to the claim/refuse/release loop ("deferred: a turn is
running" every pass). Safe (no loss, no dup) but noisy, and it holds the claim the gateway's owner pass
needs. `verified_gateway_pids(profile)` now lists both verified pids (profile
`live_gateway_pid_for_home(get_profile_dir(profile))`, then `live_default_gateway_pid()`), deduplicated;
a failed lookup drops only its own candidate. `gateway_lease_pid` matches the unexpired lease holder
against each via `gateway_owner`. Still lease-only, still `expires_at > now`, still pid-verified.

Nit 3 (test): new test with the lease on the compression lineage root and the link on the tip: three
sweeps stand aside (no claim under tip or root, no wake, no "deferred"), one "left to gateway pid" note,
and after release exactly one lineage row with the tip's ledger row DELIVERED.

Nit 2 (cosmetic, declined): reading the lease once per lineage id is kept; `session_turn_lease_owner`
maps each id to its root, and `lineage_ids` can in principle span ids with distinct roots, so a single
read would need to prove a shared root first for no behaviour gain.

Proof (hermes-core-wt test on worker-5):
- GREEN: test_kanban_remote_lease_stand_aside.py + test_kanban_remote_owner_delivery.py: 34 passed.
- RED on PR #2208 head 0421ba2884 (fifo reverted, new tests): ..._either_verified_gateway_..[default]
  fails (the gap); the profile-held control passes.
- RED on origin/main (fifo + notices at main): the [default] case, the compacted-chat test and the
  verified_gateway_pids unit test fail, along with #2208's own stand-aside tests.
- scripts/check --base origin/main: 19 checks ok.
